  "captions": [
    {
      "name": "fig_reference_rd",
      "caption": "Left: means across all 100 crops at each of five native QPs, joined only as visual guides. Right: per-image log-rate linear interpolation and paired quality differences on the four-model common support at each rate; n is explicit and can change with rate. Whiskers are 95% image-bootstrap intervals conditional on the frozen checkpoints and included cohort. D2/D4/D6 are epoch20 of105; D12 is released and is not a matched-training causal depth control. Rates are actual rANS payload, excluding the custom research header."
    },
    {
      "name": "fig_reference_coverage",
      "caption": "At0.2 actual payload bpp, compare the original monitor images0801\u20130804 with the remaining validation images, restricting both groups to the four-model common support. The small monitor subset receives no confidence interval. The coverage panel reports pairwise and four-model shared support at each rate, preventing silent extrapolation or an implicit claim that every rate uses all100 images."
    },
    {
      "name": "fig_reference_rate_accounting",
      "caption": "Left: mean actual rANS payload minus estimated entropy with pointwise95% image-bootstrap intervals. Right: average per-image BD-rate relative to releasedD12; PCHIP log-rate integration is restricted to each image\u2019s four-model common PSNR interval, and nonmonotone curves are rejected. n reports valid images. The custom88-byte header contributes an additional0.00268555bpp per512crop and is not included here. The released gap mixes depth, training progress and provenance."
    }
  ],
